    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992800/extras/23347b5a70064eb614abd2b62dc88eb5.poster.avif?t=1744240469\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992800/extras/23347b5a70064eb614abd2b62dc88eb5.webm?t=1744240469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992800/extras/23347b5a70064eb614abd2b62dc88eb5.mp4?t=1744240469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day you fell asleep strangely and woke up in a cafeteria called &quot;<strong>Nowhere</strong>&quot;, which exists beyond the material world you are used to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl with wings, part-time local barista, appears as an angel and decides to change your status from &quot;<strong>Unemployed</strong>&quot; to &quot;<strong>Catcher</strong>&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you have to <strong>hunt down demons</strong> that hide in the cracks of people's souls. Otherwise, your <strong>existence will be erased</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How did this happen?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992800/extras/46f67a5d9809e70638575f059e717581.avif?t=1744240469\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sim</strong> and <strong>management</strong>: you live an everyday life confronting routine problems while trying to hunt down demons in people's minds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your time is <strong>limited</strong>, every time you miss a day or week, demons might become stronger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl possessed by Demon has another <strong>shadow</strong> personality you have to deal with</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various <strong>mini-games</strong> are used for stats increasement and catching and fighting demons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nonlinear</strong> storytelling, where your <strong>choices</strong> are a part of your demon-fighting strategy and affect the story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992800/extras/ce285e47f4abedeaa85dd7396ecea784.poster.avif?t=1744240469\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992800/extras/ce285e47f4abedeaa85dd7396ecea784.webm?t=1744240469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992800/extras/ce285e47f4abedeaa85dd7396ecea784.mp4?t=1744240469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992800/extras/23347b5a70064eb614abd2b62dc88eb5.poster.avif?t=1744240469\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992800/extras/23347b5a70064eb614abd2b62dc88eb5.webm?t=1744240469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992800/extras/23347b5a70064eb614abd2b62dc88eb5.mp4?t=1744240469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day you fell asleep strangely and woke up in a cafeteria called &quot;<strong>Nowhere</strong>&quot;, which exists beyond the material world you are used to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl with wings, part-time local barista, appears as an angel and decides to change your status from &quot;<strong>Unemployed</strong>&quot; to &quot;<strong>Catcher</strong>&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you have to <strong>hunt down demons</strong> that hide in the cracks of people's souls. Otherwise, your <strong>existence will be erased</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How did this happen?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992800/extras/46f67a5d9809e70638575f059e717581.avif?t=1744240469\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sim</strong> and <strong>management</strong>: you live an everyday life confronting routine problems while trying to hunt down demons in people's minds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your time is <strong>limited</strong>, every time you miss a day or week, demons might become stronger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl possessed by Demon has another <strong>shadow</strong> personality you have to deal with</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various <strong>mini-games</strong> are used for stats increasement and catching and fighting demons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nonlinear</strong> storytelling, where your <strong>choices</strong> are a part of your demon-fighting strategy and affect the story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992800/extras/ce285e47f4abedeaa85dd7396ecea784.poster.avif?t=1744240469\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992800/extras/ce285e47f4abedeaa85dd7396ecea784.webm?t=1744240469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992800/extras/ce285e47f4abedeaa85dd7396ecea784.mp4?t=1744240469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
